{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04720","headline":"赠工部尚书冯公挽歌三首 三 · 张说","name":"赠工部尚书冯公挽歌三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"窅然长夜台，举世可哀哉。\n泉户一朝闭，松风四面来。\n石碑填駮藓，珠服聚尘埃。\n谁言辽东鹤，千年往复廻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04720.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04720","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}